.TH SDL_GLContextFlag 3type "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 DATATYPES"
.SH NAME
SDL_GLContextFlag \- Possible flags to be set for the
.BR SDL_GL_CONTEXT_FLAGS
attribute.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_video.h>
.PP
.BI "typedef Uint32 SDL_GLContextFlag;
.BI "
.BI "#define SDL_GL_CONTEXT_DEBUG_FLAG              0x0001
.BI "#define SDL_GL_CONTEXT_FORWARD_COMPATIBLE_FLAG 0x0002
.BI "#define SDL_GL_CONTEXT_ROBUST_ACCESS_FLAG      0x0004
.BI "#define SDL_GL_CONTEXT_RESET_ISOLATION_FLAG    0x0008
.fi
.SH AVAILABILITY
This datatype is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

